Assignment: Accessing Items from a Python Dictionary
Objective

Practice accessing values from a dictionary using keys, and learn how to safely retrieve dictionary data.
===============================================================
Task 1 — Student Information
===============================================================
Create a dictionary:

student = {
    "name": "Ali",
    "age": 20,
    "city": "Islamabad",
    "course": "Artificial Intelligence",
    "marks": 85
}

Write Python statements to:

Print the student's name.
Print the student's age.
Print the student's city.
Print the student's course.
Print the student's marks.

===============================================================
Task 2 — Employee Information
===============================================================
Create a dictionary containing:

employee ID
name
department
salary
experience

Then access and print each value using its key.
