===============================================================
Task 4 — Accessing Missing Keys
===============================================================
Given:

car = {
    "brand": "Toyota",
    "model": "Corolla",
    "year": 2022
}

Try to access:

car["color"]

Observe what happens.

Then use .get() to access "color" without causing an error.
