Task 5 — Mini Industrial Problem
===============================================================
Create an inventory dictionary:

product = {
    "id": 101,
    "name": "Laptop",
    "price": 85000,
    "stock": 15,
    "supplier": "ABC Electronics"
}

Write a program that calculates and displays:

Product: Laptop
Price: 85000
Available Stock: 15
Supplier: ABC Electronics
Total Stock Value: 1275000

Hint:

total = product["price"] * product["stock"]
